  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Electronic Configuration is the distribution of electrons in the various available orbitals of an atom of an element. </p><p>The mentioned elements are present in d-block.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mi>Cr</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>Ar</mi><mo>]</mo><mn>4</mn><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mn>3</mn><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mi>Cd</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>Kr</mi><mo>]</mo><mn>5</mn><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>10</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mi>Cu</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>Ar</mi><mo>]</mo><mn>4</mn><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mn>3</mn><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>10</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mi>Ag</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>Kr</mi><mo>]</mo><mn>5</mn><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mn>4</mn><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>10</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mi>Zn</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>Ar</mi><mo>]</mo><mn>4</mn><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>3</mn><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>10</mn></msup></math></p><p>Hence, the answer is B.</p>",
